        "cooked": "<ol>\n<li>Yes you can solve BPTs after deadline for practice.</li>\n<li>That is a normal behaviour and depends on the configuration of the server. If you leave your terminal idle for too long the connection is closed. It is there to close connections that are not actively used, to save system resources.</li>\n</ol>",
